    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "ev-4a9b8718580249746fe80935",
      "path_or_url": "loom.md",
      "section": "Loom service hall > Uniform cupboard",
      "snippet": "## Uniform cupboard\n\nClean uniforms are stored in the cedar cupboard. The laundry service collects used uniforms on Mondays.\n",
